      "description": "A supporting action with the same target, type, and corners.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-outline\" type=\"button\">Cancel</button>",
      "css": ".ds-outline{min-height:44px;padding:4px 16px;border:1px solid var(--p-control,#7f8795);border-radius:var(--p-radius-control,10px);background:transparent;color:var(--p-text,#25272c);font:500 14px/20px ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-outline:hover:not(:disabled),.ds-outline:active:not(:disabled),.ds-outline:focus-visible{background:var(--p-raised,#eef1f6)}.ds-outline:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--p-accent,#365ccb);outline-offset:3px}.ds-outline:disabled{color:var(--p-muted,#606674);cursor:default}@media(forced-colors:active){.ds-outline{border-color:ButtonText}.ds-outline:focus-visible{outline-color:Highlight}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Quiet action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-ghost",
      "description": "Low-emphasis action that retains a full focus and target treatment.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-ghost\" type=\"button\">Clear filters</button>",
      "css": ".ds-ghost{min-height:44px;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:var(--p-radius-control,10px);background:transparent;color:var(--p-text,#25272c);font:500 14px/20px ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-ghost:hover:not(:disabled),.ds-ghost:active:not(:disabled){background:var(--p-raised,#eef1f6)}.ds-ghost:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--p-accent,#365ccb);outline-offset:3px}.ds-ghost:disabled{color:var(--p-muted,#606674);cursor:default}@media(forced-colors:active){.ds-ghost:focus-visible{outline-color:Highlight}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Guided field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "text-field",
      "description": "Phase 2 anatomy reference: label and persistent guidance precede the entered value. Phase 1 supplies the reusable foundations; its default field keeps label, control, then help/error.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-field\"><label class=\"ds-label\" for=\"ds-workspace\">Workspace name</label><p class=\"ds-help\" id=\"ds-workspace-help\">This name appears in review invitations.</p><input class=\"ds-input\" id=\"ds-workspace\" aria-describedby=\"ds-workspace-help\" value=\"Cinder studio\"></div>",
      "css": ".ds-field{max-width:360px;color:var(--p-text,#25272c);font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif}.ds-label{display:block;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600}.ds-help{margin:4px 0 8px;color:var(--p-muted,#606674);font-size:13px;line-height:20px}.ds-input{display:block;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;min-height:44px;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid var(--p-control,#7f8795);border-radius:var(--p-radius-control,10px);background:var(--p-surface,#fff);color:var(--p-text,#25272c);font:400 16px/24px ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;caret-color:var(--p-accent,#365ccb)}.ds-input:hover:not(:disabled):not(:read-only){border-color:var(--p-text,#25272c)}.ds-input:focus{outline:2px solid var(--p-accent,#365ccb);outline-offset:2px}.ds-input:read-only{border-style:dashed;background:var(--p-raised,#eef1f6)}.ds-field ::selection{background:var(--p-active,#e7edff);color:var(--p-text,#25272c)}@media(forced-colors:active){.ds-input:focus{outline-color:Highlight}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Attached recovery",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "recovery",
      "description": "Phase 2 anatomy reference: guidance stays above, recovery attaches below, and focus remains separate. This static invalid preview does not describe the Phase 1 default composition.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-invalid-field\"><label class=\"ds-invalid-label\" for=\"ds-email\">Reply-to email <span class=\"ds-required\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Required</span></label><p class=\"ds-invalid-help\" id=\"ds-email-help\">Replies to review summaries go to this address.</p><input class=\"ds-invalid-input\" id=\"ds-email\" type=\"email\" required aria-invalid=\"true\" aria-describedby=\"ds-email-help ds-email-error\" value=\"not-an-email\"><div class=\"ds-error\" id=\"ds-email-error\"><svg class=\"ds-error-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 6 4 4M6 10l4-4M14 8A6 6 0 1 1 2 8a6 6 0 0 1 12 0\"/></svg><span>Enter an email address, such as reviews@cinder.example.</span></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-invalid-field{max-width:360px;color:var(--p-text,#25272c);font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif}.ds-invalid-label{display:flex;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 10px;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600}.ds-required{font-size:12px;font-weight:400;color:var(--p-muted,#606674)}.ds-invalid-help{margin:4px 0 8px;color:var(--p-muted,#606674);font-size:13px;line-height:20px}.ds-invalid-input{display:block;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;min-height:44px;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid var(--p-error,#aa2735);border-radius:var(--p-radius-control,10px) var(--p-radius-control,10px) 3px 3px;background:var(--p-surface,#fff);color:var(--p-text,#25272c);font:400 16px/24px ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;caret-color:var(--p-accent,#365ccb)}.ds-invalid-input:hover{border-color:var(--p-error,#aa2735)}.ds-invalid-input:focus{outline:2px solid var(--p-accent,#365ccb);outline-offset:2px}.ds-error{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;margin-top:-1px;padding:9px 12px;border:1px solid var(--p-error,#aa2735);border-top:0;border-radius:0 0 var(--p-radius-control,10px) var(--p-radius-control,10px);background:var(--p-error-bg,#ffe8eb);color:var(--p-error,#aa2735);font-size:13px;line-height:20px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-error-icon{flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px}.ds-invalid-field ::selection{background:var(--p-active,#e7edff);color:var(--p-text,#25272c)}@media(forced-colors:active){.ds-invalid-input{border-style:dashed}.ds-invalid-input:focus{outline-color:Highlight}.ds-error{color:CanvasText;background:Canvas;border-color:CanvasText}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Current navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation-current",
      "description": "Prototype navigation reference: current location has a blue selected surface and a programmatic current state. Full reusable navigation coverage follows the foundation phase.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-navigation\" aria-label=\"Sample workspace\"><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"/prototypes?variant=frame&amp;view=workspace\" aria-current=\"page\">Reviews</a><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"/prototypes?variant=frame&amp;view=settings\">Settings</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-navigation{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.ds-nav-item{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;box-sizing:border-box;min-height:44px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:var(--p-radius-control,10px);color:var(--p-text,#25272c);font:500 14px/20px ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;text-decoration:none}.ds-nav-item:hover,.ds-nav-item:active{background:var(--p-raised,#eef1f6)}.ds-nav-item[aria-current=page]{background:var(--p-active,#e7edff);color:var(--p-accent,#365ccb)}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--p-accent,#365ccb);outline-offset:3px}@media(forced-colors:active){.ds-nav-item[aria-current=page]{outline:1px solid Highlight}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid Highlight}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Review status",
      "kind": "chip",
      "description": "A static status communicates attention with words as well as a color and mark.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-status\"><span class=\"ds-status-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Needs review</span>",
      "css": ".ds-status{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:var(--p-radius-control,10px);background:var(--p-warning-bg,#fff0ce);color:var(--p-warning,#75500d);font:400 13px/20px ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif}.ds-status-mark{width:7px;height:7px;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor}@media(forced-colors:active){.ds-status{color:CanvasText;background:Canvas;outline:1px solid CanvasText}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Grouped form surface",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "grouped-surface",
      "description": "Opaque grouping with a quiet boundary; no ambient card shadow. Padding is the settings recipe, not a universal container API.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-surface\" aria-labelledby=\"ds-surface-title\"><h2 class=\"ds-surface-title\" id=\"ds-surface-title\">Workspace details</h2><p class=\"ds-surface-copy\">Use a name the team recognizes and an address that can receive replies.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-surface{max-width:440px;padding:28px;border:1px solid var(--p-border,#dde1e8);border-radius:var(--p-radius-group,14px);background:var(--p-surface,#fff);color:var(--p-text,#25272c);font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif}.ds-surface-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:600}.ds-surface-copy{margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--p-muted,#606674)}@media(max-width:720px){.ds-surface{padding:20px}}@media(forced-colors:active){.ds-surface{border-color:CanvasText}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "A clear frame for the task",
    "overview": "Frame makes a field's purpose, instructions, value, and recovery read as one unit. Cool neutral surfaces and restrained geometry leave room for content. A neutral primary action makes commitment clear; blue identifies focus and selection.\n\nPhase 1 implements the light/dark foundations, representative action/field/overlay styling, and public customization contracts in the packages. The guided-field and attached-recovery previews show the Phase 2 anatomy target. These eight static previews remain illustrative; authored tokens, package documentation, and recorded verification define the implemented contract.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Guidance before the input; recovery attached below it.",
      "Quiet surfaces with stronger interactive boundaries.",
      "Neutral actions, blue focus and selection, explicit status meaning.",
      "Comfortable controls and content that can grow.",
      "The same visual language in light and dark themes."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Separate Signals Rule",
        "body": "Focus, selection, current location, validation, and destructive intent must remain distinguishable when they occur together.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Readable Value Rule",
        "body": "Do not shrink entered values, critical instructions, or recovery text to make a layout fit. Reflow the surrounding layout instead.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Stable Recovery Rule",
        "body": "Reserve enough space for the form's expected errors to keep its commit action stable, while allowing longer messages to grow.",
        "section": "layout"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** keep guidance visible while recovery is shown.",
      "**Do** keep focus distinct on selected and invalid controls.",
      "**Do** use stronger boundaries for controls than for ordinary surfaces.",
      "**Do** let content, translations, and text scaling increase a component's height.",
      "**Do** verify the same task in both themes and at narrow widths.",
      "**Do** carry verified code and token decisions into Figma at the final handoff."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** use placeholders as the only field labels.",
      "**Don't** rely on color alone for validation, selection, or status.",
      "**Don't** clip an error to preserve a screenshot's height.",
      "**Don't** turn every content section or data row into a rounded card.",
      "**Don't** infer a public API or full accessibility support from a prototype image.",
      "**Don't** copy a reference library's visual identity or API wholesale."
    ]
  }
}
